kind":"update","title":"Demo update: reworked prologue, improved battle visuals and loading","summary":"Hi everyone, Juanmao here. The Demo has another update, and it's free to download on Steam for both Windows and macOS. This one mainly covers three things: the prologue, the battle visuals, and stutter. Prologue: two fights, no choices The prologue for new saves no longer has any choices. You go straight into two battles. In the first, the screen pauses for a beat when someone fires an ultimate, and enemies flash a warning before they cast a skill, so it's easier to see who's about to act. The s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:22:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038548","verified_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1847286114031529","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: new battle effects and an opening fight for new saves","summary":"Hi everyone, Juanmao here. After Demo v3 went live, some of you said the battles looked a little plain. Others wanted the tutorial to get out of the way. This update tackles both, and it's available to play on Steam now. Battles finally look and sound different All twelve classes have their own hit effects, and basic attacks now have more distinct animations. Swords, spears, bows, and fists no longer make the same impact sound. I'd watched everyone swing in much the same way for so long that eve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:15:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031529","verified_at":"2026-10-22T11:20:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1846651706684266","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v3 arrives October 20, with stages up to 800","summary":"Hi everyone, Juanmao here. Demo v3 is coming on October 20. The last version stopped at stage 200. This time you can keep going all the way to stage 800, with plenty more room to build your team. Here is what I have been working on. Some new faces at the Agency You can recruit 14 new heroes in this Demo. Some drop during the campaign; the other seven are five-star heroes, recruited at the Tavern with their tokens and a Legendary Recruitment Ticket. Five-star heroes also get a close-up when they ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:30:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1846018067935965","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v2 is here: you can now play all the way to Stage 200!","summary":"Hi everyone, I'm Juanmao. Thank you to everyone who has tried the demo these past few days! Demo v2 is now available. I've added quite a few things to our little agency, so here's a look at what's changed. From 60 stages to 200 The first demo ended at Stage 60. Now you can take your team further and meet more heroes along the way. There are 62 heroes available to obtain in this version. Beat a boss, welcome a new teammate On your first victory in a Boss Challenge, the corresponding hero now join","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T10:52:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1846018067932289","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"announcement","title":"Idle Agency Demo Is Live! Our Little Agency Is Ready to Welcome You","summary":"The Idle Agency Demo is live on Steam! You can download and play it for free now! From the first spark of an idea to seeing the heroes take their places on the battlefield, this little agency has slowly come to life through countless changes and reworks. Being able to put it in your hands at last makes me both happy and nervous! Here's a quick introduction to the game, along with answers to a few questions you may have. What kind of game is it? In a nutshell: hero collecting + strategic team bui","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T06:26:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932289","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1846018067928138","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"update","title":"October 8 Update | Straight Into the First Fight","summary":"New players now go straight into Stage 1. The prologue becomes in-battle subtitles, and naming comes later. This part is still under construction, so it is not the finished version yet. Defeat guidance has changed too: advancement is folded into the upgrade step, and each step appears at most once per defeat. Repeated and skipped prompts are fixed, but I have not finished validating this part yet. A few more things: group upgrades and advancement need one preview and one confirmation. Recommende","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T02:52:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928138","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1845383656392405","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"update","title":"October 5 Update | Sorting Out Who Gives Shields","summary":"This time I sorted out the support roles. Shields now come from the appropriate classes, and I went through the physical and magical damage paths too. Shield-related equipment is still useful, so your collection has not gone to waste. A few awkward display issues are fixed as well: percentage bonuses no longer appear twice. The formation screen labels allied positions, and aura descriptions tell you which team and how many rows they affect. Less guesswork. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46216320/82ff2f111ee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T02:10:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1845383656388509","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"update","title":"October 3 Update | Check the Loot Before You Idle","summary":"First up: idling. When choosing a chapter, you can now preview its materials, sets, and legendary drops. Quantities increase with campaign progress. Targeted commissions also have badges for “already owned” and “not dropped here,” so you know what you are farming for. Then there are the click-savers: Academy research unlocks automatic Market trades for base materials and purchases of the day’s recruitment tickets. Free research rushes are used automatically. Break through runes in one click with","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T06:50:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1845383656384954","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"update","title":"October 2 Update | A New Look for the Academy","summary":"The Academy got most of the attention this time. The overview circle, four skill-tree branches, info cards, era tabs, and total bonuses all have new designs and animations. Drag and zoom the skill tree, select a node to focus on it, and clear the selection to return. Want your total bonuses? Just click the sign. There is an ink-wash entrance effect, gold connections between learned nodes, and research connections that light up as progress advances. All twelve classes now have a class trait that ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T05:16:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384954","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4855890-1845383656380383","game_id":"steam-4855890","kind":"announcement","title":"An idle game without gacha: please wishlist Idle Agency!","summary":"Hi everyone, I'm Juanmao, the developer of an indie game called Idle Agency. The battles run automatically. You figure out the formation. Arrange your heroes on a 4×4 grid and let them fight. Progress continues while you're offline, so you can return to a pile of rewards. There are 146 heroes to collect without gacha. It's a buy-to-play game with no stamina system and no daily check-in pressure. A free demo will be available during Steam Next Fest, and I'll keep working on the game. There's stil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T08:49:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380383","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4855890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4855890":"2026-10-26T04:46:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4855890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:51Z",